# Template for .env — copy to `.env` (gitignored). SECRETS only, and deliberately NOT VITE_-prefixed
# so Vite never exposes them to the client bundle (client vars live in env.vite).
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Umami reporting API key — read-back of stats only (server-side); the browser tracker never needs it.
# Name matches the agora-server env var (env.AGORA_UMAMI_API_KEY). Get it from your Umami instance
# (Settings → API keys, or a self-hosted login token).
AGORA_UMAMI_API_KEY=your-umami-reporting-api-key-here
